{
  "quirk": "OpenCode 2.x lists its own subagent sessions beside the user's chats with no parent field: the parent's stream names them (_meta[\"opencode/child-session\"] id and parentID on projected child updates, rawOutput.metadata.sessionID on the subagent tool result, tool kind think), and a replay whose first user message starts with the subagent preamble marks that session. The listing marks those, plus the exact untitled child title and the 1.x \" (@agent subagent)\" title; near-miss titles and messages stay ordinary chats.",
